    "body": "This looks good to me, although you'll need to add a reference to the BigInt spec similar to https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#import() . (No need for a bulletted list, just a sentence and a bibliography entry.)\r\n\r\nWe'll also need Igalia to sign the participation agreement.\r\n\r\nFinally we'll need multi-implementer interest.",
